    <h1 class="display" style="font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 56px); line-height: 1.05; margin: 0 0 28px;">Privacy policy</h1>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>Riptide makes immersive and interactive theatre, on city streets, on your phone and through your letterbox. When you book with us, join our list or take part in one of our experiences, we look after the personal information you give us. This page explains what we collect, why, who else handles it and what you can ask us to do with it.</p>
    <p>Riptide Theatre Ltd ("Riptide", "we"), a company registered in England and Wales (number 12489037), is the data controller and is registered with the Information Commissioner's Office. Our address is Patrick Studios, St Mary's Lane, Leeds LS9 7EH. For anything about your data, email <a href="mailto:info@theriptide.co.uk">info@theriptide.co.uk</a>.</p>

