    <p>We don't sell your data, and we don't use it for advertising.</p>

    <h2>Project Intimacy</h2>
    <p>Project Intimacy asks personal questions, so here is exactly what happens to your answers.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Your questionnaire goes into a Google Sheet that only the Riptide team can open. We use it to pair you with a partner, and for nothing else.</li>
      <li>Your partner never sees your questionnaire or your full name. Because the fortnight happens on WhatsApp, your partner will be able to see your phone number. That's why we ask you to anonymise your WhatsApp profile before you start. Everything else is yours to share or keep.</li>
      <li>All the longer, open questions are optional, including the one about political views. If you answer the political views question, you are giving us explicit consent to use that answer for pairing. You can withdraw that consent at any time by emailing us.</li>
      <li>We delete questionnaires six months after your run ends, and WhatsApp conversations when your run ends.</li>
      <li>The experience is for adults only (18+).</li>
    </ul>

