    <p>Where a service stores data outside the UK, it does so under UK-approved safeguards, such as the UK's data adequacy rules or standard contractual clauses.</p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>We don't use advertising or tracking cookies. The site sets one cookie of its own, and only if you book Reset or Sonder: it keeps you signed in, and the site can't work without it. Stripe's checkout and Vimeo's player may set their own cookies when you use them, to prevent fraud and play video.</p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>You can ask us to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>give you a copy of the personal data we hold about you</li>
      <li>correct anything that's wrong</li>
      <li>delete your data, unless we must keep it by law (payment records, for example)</li>
      <li>stop or limit how we use it, or object to our using it</li>
      <li>send your data to you or someone else in a usable format</li>
      <li>withdraw your consent, for the newsletter or the optional Project Intimacy question, at any time</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Email <a href="mailto:info@theriptide.co.uk">info@theriptide.co.uk</a> and we'll reply within one month. There's no charge.</p>

    <h2>Complaints</h2>
    <p>If you're unhappy with how we've handled your data, please tell us first so we can put it right. You can also complain to the Information Commissioner's Office at <a href="https://ico.org.uk/make-a-complaint/">ico.org.uk</a> or on 0303 123 1113.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>If we change this policy, we'll post the new version here with the date it changed.</p>
